      "notes": "For My Kingdom is a narrative-driven card game about ruling a medieval kingdom.\r\nIts mature content is entirely thematic. As king you make harsh decisions\r\ninvolving execution, torture, slavery and death in war, but none of it is shown\r\non screen and everything is conveyed through text. Some portraits are painted in\r\na realistic style and include bloodstains and wounded faces. Wine trade and\r\ndrinking at court feasts are recurring themes. The game also deals with the\r\nreligious tensions of the era. Treating other faiths with tolerance or\r\nintolerance is the player's choice, and every choice carries a cost that the\r\nkingdom bears. There is no nudity, sexual content, drugs or gambling."
    }
